PROJECT NAME: UNITED NATION GOLD CHASE BANK

PROJECT TYPE

Online banking-style digital wallet with a website and mobile application.

OBJECTIVE

Build a professional, modern digital wallet called UNITED NATION GOLD CHASE BANK. The project must include a fully functional website and mobile application, supported by a shared backend and persistent database.

The website must be accessible through a public web address. The mobile application must be designed for Android, iOS, and laptop use.

The application should have a professional banking appearance, using navy blue, white, and elegant gold as its primary colors.

The project name is the name selected for this independent application. Do not claim that the application is owned, operated, endorsed, or officially affiliated with the United Nations, UNJSPF, or Chase Bank.

IMPORTANT: The initial version will be a wallet prototype. Design the backend so legitimate payment services can be integrated in the future.

